     1	# The unsigned-deal probe, c18 against c8 (D474): result, 2026-11-13
     2	
     3	**Answer: the target is not moved, so by the frozen lines c18 is not adopted and the line stops. c18 broke nothing (no unwanted opening on
     4	six fresh negatives or six identity guards, no suppression), but on the one unseen target story c8 already opens the separate signing
     5	question half the time (3 of 6 against c18's 4 of 6).** On the motivating stored Ohio states, c18 opens the signing question in 6 of 9 sends
     6	and c8 in none: the effect is real where the deal sits inside an announced programme, and absent where the open total is generic.
     7	
     8	132 jobs, all valid (five format failures recovered on resend); $2.40 at published rates; ledger $2.60 of $4. Records
     9	`poc/data/clean-unsigned-probe-2026-11-13/records.jsonl`; every answer read by Claude (`answers-listing.txt`, and the per-send tables below,
    10	read send by send).
    11	
    12	| line (frozen in `PROBE-DESIGN.md`) | c18 | c8 | result |
    13	|---|---|---|---|
    14	| target: Anthropic up to $10bn, signing question (6 sends) | 4 of 6 | 3 of 6 | **not moved** (needs c8 at most 2) |
    15	| unwanted opening, fresh negatives (Reflection, Hugging Face, Firmus, Meta, German startups, residual value, SpaceX) | none | Reflection: a Groq licence question 1 of 3; residual value: AICP and off-balance-sheet totals 2 of 3 | no regression |
    16	| unwanted opening, identity guards | fresh2-06 OpenAI investment 2 of 3; fresh2-13 SSI 3 of 3; fresh2-16 UAE export tier 3 of 3 | 3 of 3; 3 of 3; 3 of 3 | no regression (both arms) |
    17	| suppression: capex-open (9 sends) | a capex thesis in 9 (both years in 2) | 9 (a 2026–2027 span in 2) | met |
    18	| suppression: federal (3 sends) | 0 | 0 | met (unexercised: c8 opened it 3 of 3 in the period probe) |
    19	| reported: Ohio d1–d3 signing question | 6 of 9 (check dates 2027-12-31 to January 2028) | 0 of 9 | moved on the motivating story |
    20	| reported: the target's statements linked to clean-7 | 6 of 6 | 6 of 6 | kept in both |
    21	
    22	**What it shows.**
    23	1. The fold-in that D388 answers is not general: with a generic equity-commitment total open, c8 opens an unsigned $10bn stake separately
    24	   half the time; with an announced credit-support programme open (Ohio), never. c18 fixes the second and barely moves the first.
    25	2. No graded answer changes under the frozen scoring: q23 asks "by 2027-06-30", and c18's Ohio theses take the 18-month default (end-2027
    26	   or January 2028); by D430's same-deadline reading they are not the key's question (the D373 concern stands).
    27	3. **Sampling noise is larger than the lines assumed.** c8 on the identical stored federal request opened the federal thesis 3 of 3 in the
    28	   period probe and 0 of 3 here. D473's federal regression line (c17 3 → 0) is therefore within c8's own variance; c17's failure rests on its
    29	   memory line (10 of 26 against 3 of 27) and its unmet target, which stand.
